sources.value_for_parodi:
This is the only free, keyless, machine-readable source for the current EU import duty on honey by origin and for live EU TRQ fill. It feeds the EU column of the per-origin duty matrix automatically:
- MFN 17.3%;
- Ukraine 0% in-quota under the revised DCFTA TRQ (35,000 t), 17.3% out-of-quota;
- Serbia (XS) 0%;
- Vietnam EVFTA;
- the India GSP rate, or India appearing in excluded_countries if graduated;
- the Mexico TRQ;
- the Mercosur TRQ for AR/BR/UY/PY if and when the interim agreement is applied. A new 143 measure appearing is the automatic signal.
The Ukraine quota balance and the speed it is drawn down are a market signal for Ukrainian honey pressure on EU bulk prices. That signal is fresher than Comext and complements the TAXUD weekly imports already integrated. Each measure's regulation_url gives an official EUR-Lex link for the UI.

