sources.data_available:
Each message (recalled structure):
- message number and date, category (AD/CVD), type (e.g. cash deposit, liquidation, 'lift suspension');
- case numbers with company suffixes (e.g. A-351-857-001 for a specific exporter/producer, -000 for all-others);
- country and product ('Raw honey from Brazil');
- FR citation, effective date;
- a table of exporter/producer combinations with the new cash-deposit rate (%) or, for some China honey segments, a per-unit USD/kg rate.

Per country × HS-10 (0409000005/10/35/45/56/65) × month:
- general imports value (USD, customs value) and quantity (kg);
- imports for consumption value and quantity;
- CIF value;
- dutiable value (DUT_VAL_MO) and calculated duty (CAL_DUT_MO), both USD.
Country codes are Census Schedule C: Argentina 3570, Brazil 3510, Uruguay 3550, China 5700, India 5330, Vietnam 5520, Ukraine 4623, Mexico 2010, Canada 1220, Turkey 4890, Thailand 5490, Hungary 4370, Romania 4850; Serbia code unverified.

Public versions of:
- the preliminary and final results Issues & Decision Memoranda;
- the calculation memoranda (public summaries);
- the scope text, including the definition of 'raw honey' (a filtration threshold) that decides whether finely filtered honey is covered;
- respondent selection and questionnaires;
- review requests listing every exporter for which a review was requested.
